# Present useful metadata

## Requirement

Support meaningful presentation of selected metadata in preview when appropriate; specific fields require separate design.

## Traceability

- `inputs/externals/objectives.md` · Specific objectives 6
- `inputs/externals/definitions.md` · 4. Editing modes / Preview

## Verification

Verify the stated behavior through a focused acceptance test or documented inspection. Detailed test cases will be defined during design.
